            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Rotting Flesh"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "Any creature that hits the Gray Gardener enforcer with an unarmed attack, tries to Grapple them, or otherwise touches the gurgist is covered with rotten flesh and putrid fluids. The creature must succeed at a"
